    },
    {
      "id": "tang-787",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "宿云际寺赠深上人",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "李端",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "暂别青蓝寺，今来发欲斑。\n独眠孤烛下，风雨在前山。\n坏宅终须去，空门不易还。\n支公有方便，一愿启玄关。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "1e6ebf39712e20ce10563ddf1b400d7f1a6a1513b0ac118941c622c635e5b140",
      "estimatedOutput": 702,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-787--1e6ebf39712e20ce10563ddf1b400d7f1a6a1513b0ac118941c622c635e5b140.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-788",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "利仁北街作",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "白居易",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "草色斑斑春雨晴，利仁坊北面西行。\n踟蹰立马缘何事，认得张家歌吹声。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "e13f91ec9b4b1668e0310c891d223609544f3f8373f17e4811754b8f7a68d9ac",
      "estimatedOutput": 666,
